    "identifier": "gale-fracture-storm-terror",
    "description": "<p>Also, at 6th Level, you learn a new molding technique called Gale Fracture.</p>\n<p>Gale Fracture. When you cast a Ninjutsu with the Wind Release keyword, you can spend 2 Focus to embolden the jutsu cast sundering an enemy’s defenses. All affected creatures who fail the jutsu’s saving throw (or if the jutsu doesn’t force a saving throw affected creatures must make a Dexterity saving throw vs your Ninjutsu save DC.) on a failed save they suffer a -2 penalty to their AC and a -1 to their saving throws until the beginning of your next turn.</p>",
